{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NgiL8NkBs31795760574.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人植耀輝於節目中推介美團(3690)，除了憧憬第三季業績持續改善之外，科技股超賣後有望反彈，但提醒短線部署並嚴守止蝕。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262ljuVm95zT1795760583.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>植耀輝建議65.7元買入，目標價是買入價高一成，止蝕價定於買入價低8%。</p><p></p><p>美團(3690)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$65.7</p><p>目標：買入價+10%</p><p>止蝕：買入價-8%</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DM5bcjMPm01795760612.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人張智威推介三倍做空納指ETF (SQQQ)，一來美國民主黨政策或阻礙AI發展，其次是加息不利科企融資，以及科企負現金流未見止血，都拖累納指表現。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269UhYeGIK6k1795760595.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>張智威建議39美元才部署，目標價看45美元，止蝕價定於33美元。</p><p></p><p>三倍做空納指ETF(SQQQ)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：39美元</p><p>目標：45美元</p><p>止蝕：33美元</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:43:53.555891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:46:55.085012+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:15.456304+00:00","content_hash":"28784a38a3eab711bcc6f39303ccd2d07095b63f9e2305c012d591d2c9d0c9a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:43:53.555891+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}